This plugin is a derivative work of the Omarchy project
(https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy), which is MIT licensed.

`BarWidget.qml` is adapted from Omarchy's own menu bar widget
(shell/plugins/menu/BarWidget.qml): the WidgetButton structure, the
`horizontalMargin` value, and both click actions are upstream's, carried
over near-verbatim. The changes here are the glyph (U+F011 in place of
upstream's private-font U+E900), the tooltip, and the plain-Item root the
third-party plugin loader injects into.

